# Settings for this checkout that are not for git. Copy this file to .env,
# make the copy yours alone (chmod 600 .env), and fill it in with an editor.
# .env is ignored by git; this example is committed and holds no value.

# The API key the classifier (pnpm tag, and the app's own tagging) signs in
# to the Claude API with. Create it in the Claude Console, in a workspace
# with a spend limit.
#
# The name is this project's own on purpose. Do not rename it to
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY, and do not add that variable here: under that name a
# key takes precedence over a Claude Code subscription login wherever the
# file is loaded, and bills that work to the API. The classifier reads this
# line from this file and nothing else.
X_BOOKMARKS_ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# Whether the app may tag by itself: classify newly captured bookmarks, and
# ask about a tag you have just added, without you running pnpm tag. That
# spends money from the key above with nobody watching, at most $0.10 a pass
# and $0.30 a day, so it is off unless you turn it on here. Only the value
# "on" does; leave it empty and the app never sends anything to the API by
# itself. Nothing in the app can change this for you: it is read from this
# file, at each pass. pnpm tag is yours to run either way.
X_BOOKMARKS_APP_TAGGING=
